{"items":[{"id":"806121504","root":"806121504","user":{"id":"35766977","name":"33又77","avatar":"4efdd120d0968d5504f9ce70"},"text":"给新朋友介绍一下，水姐（水曜日、1001project）是跟祈太（祈Inory）一个时代的up主，全能型个人势，早年跟祈太合作过多个作品。当时AcFun因为坚持“就算倒闭也不会收用户一分钱”而闭站，水姐没有签约入驻他站，而是等AcFun复活重新回来直播，并成为AcFun复活之后第一批签约主播。水姐从没有主动“炫耀”过自己曾经辉煌的过往，是个坚持初心的人。水姐是个非常非常温柔的人，看水姐直播这么多年也没见水姐对谁有发过脾气，平时也像知心大姐姐一样对待着直播间的肥肥。总之，水姐的人格魅力和个人闪光点等待着新老朋友去发现。快来关注温柔、善良、美丽、可爱……（此处省略N多赞美词）的1001project吧[emot=acfun,1816/]","time":1778131981721,"floor":71,"likes":124,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":3,"hot":true,"replyPreview":[{"id":"806227744","root":"806121504","user":{"id":"77522343","name":"方糖猫猫_belong","avatar":"a65f0bd0a0915a38c026f8ee"},"text":"小猫看出来了 泥是真爱粉喵(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡","time":1779167753420,"floor":1,"likes":4,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"806319765","root":"806121504","user":{"id":"62834203","name":"血之帝王","avatar":"c6dab38fc74ed7d7af50cf68"},"text":"加一。","time":1779983797818,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"方糖猫猫_belong","replyToUserId":"77522343","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"806901105","root":"806121504","user":{"id":"78064750","name":"良辰美景奈何天的胡文蕾","avatar":"aa9230de4dd4f6bb8c86ba56"},"text":"感谢老资历\n","time":1786552952515,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"方糖猫猫_belong","replyToUserId":"77522343","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"806118419","root":"806118419","user":{"id":"11482441","name":"我不知道你知不知你道知不我","avatar":"a04ad311bc8d74d4b17df0c4"},"text":"纯新人，主包好厉害的样子","time":1778108944219,"floor":70,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"806118099","root":"806118099","user":{"id":"3432782","name":"莫德灬凯撒","avatar":"115a466a4c9ac453e025b945"},"text":"新人跟我喊：水～姐～～","time":1778093446671,"floor"